<p>In an overpowering display of marksmanship, you fire your steamgun(s) twice in rapid succession.</p><p>Each shot (targeted separately) deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">42%, 51%, 58%, 64%, 70%</acronym> damage and stuns its target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> turns.</p><p>The stun chance increases with your Steampower.</p>